   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Summing up",
     "texto": [
      "**Короче** is colloquial and can sound abrupt; **словом** means «in a word» or «in short» and usually appears in careful narration or conversation, but on its own it is not a formal formula.",
      "**То есть** clarifies or reformulates; **иначе говоря** is equivalent to «put another way» and is usually more typical of careful exposition. The register depends on the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Clarifying",
     "texto": [
      "**То есть** («that is») and **иначе говоря** («in other words») explain better: **Он ведущий, то есть главный** («He is the presenter, that is, the main one»). **Иначе говоря, это ошибка** («Put another way, it is a mistake»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
